<title>CROATIA: TABLE - Croatian Ericsson unit 1996 net.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Croatian Ericsson unit 1996 net.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for calendar 1996.</p>
<p>Millions of kuna unless otherwise stated</p>
<p>    net profit		     80.05	vs   68.65</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit		103.40	vs   90.07</p>
<p>    tax				23.35	vs   21.43</p>
<p>    total income		  969.18	vs  794.12</p>
<p>    dividend (kuna)		 4.25	vs    4.9</p>
<p>Note - Ericsson Nikola Tesla d.d. is the Croatian subsidiary of Sweden's LM Ericsson Telefon AB. Ericsson bought a 49 percent stake in Tesla from the Croatian state privatisation agency in May 1995.</p>
<p>-- Zagreb newsroom +385 1 455 7075</p>
</text>
